    "text": "<p>The rate of <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow></msub><mn>1</mn></math> reaction <math><mo>&#8733;</mo></math> stability of carbocation<br />stability of carbocation <math><mo>&#8733;</mo><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></math> charge delocation.<br /><math><mo>&#8733;</mo><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8200;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8200;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></math><br />Order of effect effectiveness<br /><math><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mo>(</mo><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#62;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mo>(</mo><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>)</mo></math><br />D&nbsp;<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/10eb0bdc-0f07-4274-b7ae-486277a9fafb-image.png\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 172px;\" /></p><p>C&nbsp;<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/28260e42-48e8-45ff-891e-ca39741cb142-image.png\" style=\"width: 202px; height: 145px;\" /></p><p>A&nbsp;<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/92c6998e-9992-4e24-a14d-c3105057d88a-image.png\" style=\"width: 164px; height: 127px;\" /></p><p>B&nbsp;<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/338eb1f3-fafb-4465-a39e-9046280181c4-image.png\" style=\"width: 206px; height: 115px;\" /><br />So, order of stability <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi></math></p>",
